# core/data/talk/grammar/en/topic_work.tlk - T5b-TOPIC: replies by topic kind (root=work) for ASK_ABOUT, ASK_OPINION, TELL and the opinion acts. Kid-safe. Syntax: core/tools/talkc_gen.py.
@rule core.ask_about.work_pro guard: root=work&stance=pro act: opine_pos
  "{x:cap}? Honest work. I'd take a shift, a short one."
  "{x:cap}! I salute anyone who does it. From a chair."
  "{x:cap}? The town runs on it. And on snacks."
  "{x:cap}? I'd do it. If I had the hat."
  "{x:cap}? Hard, honest, good. I respect that."
  "{x:cap}? I'm paid in biscuits, and I love it."
@rule core.ask_about.work_con guard: root=work&stance=con act: opine_neg
  "{x:cap}? I got fired in one afternoon. I deserved it."
  "{x:cap}? Too much standing. I'd rather sit."
  "{x:cap}? I'd rather nap. Naps pay in dreams."
  "{x:cap}? The pay is a pat on the head."
  "{x:cap}? Not for me. I tried once, the chair broke."
  "{x:cap}? I'd quit in a week. I quit in a day."
@rule core.ask_about.work_neu guard: root=work&stance=neutral act: answer
  "{x:cap}? Someone has to do it. Not me, but someone."
  "{x:cap}? My cousin does that. Or he did, he left."
  "{x:cap}? I think there's a form for it."
  "{x:cap}? It's a living. A small, polite living."
  "{x:cap}? The mayor handles that. When he's awake."
  "{x:cap}? I'd need to see a uniform first."
@rule core.ask_about.work_joke guard: root=work act: joke
  "{x:cap}? I'm good at it. I'm just never on time."
  "{x:cap}? It's a job. It's a good job to dodge."
  "{x:cap}? My boss said I'm irreplaceable. I checked, he meant it badly."
@rule core.ask_opinion.work guard: root=work act: answer
  "{x:cap}? A fine job, as jobs go."
  "My take on {x}: good hours, bad coffee."
  "{x:cap}? Honest work. I'd tip, if I had pockets."
  "{x:cap}? It's a lot of standing. I'd get tired."
  "{x:cap}? Solid. Respectable, hat optional."
  "{x:cap}? Every town needs one. Ours has two, and they argue."
@rule core.tell.work_pro guard: root=work&stance=pro act: opine_pos
  "{x:cap}! Good for you. I'd bring you a sandwich."
  "A person with {x} in their life has purpose. Respect."
  "You do {x}? Tell me everything. Slowly."
@rule core.tell.work_con guard: root=work&stance=con act: opine_neg
  "{x:cap}? Rough. Hang in there, and take your breaks."
  "That sounds like a long shift. I'd bring tea."
  "Ah, {x}. Tomorrow's another day. Or a different job."
@rule core.opine_pos.work_agree guard: root=work&stance=pro act: agree
  "Yes! {x:cap} is honest work. We should all give it a go."
  "Right? It's tough, but it's a good thing."
@rule core.opine_pos.work_disagree guard: root=work&stance=con act: disagree
  "{x:cap}? Hm, I'd pass. I like sitting."
  "Not for me. The hours alone."
@rule core.opine_neg.work_agree guard: root=work&stance=con act: agree
  "Ha, {x}. Yes. Too many forms."
  "Right? I'd rather watch the fog."
@rule core.opine_neg.work_disagree guard: root=work&stance=pro act: disagree
  "Hey, {x} is good work. Give it respect."
  "Not {x}! It pays in pride. And a small salary."
